                                                "sense_id": "f7ed6987-7d36-3971-9e02-78740d184562",
                                                "text": "It was obvious from the prosecutions opening speech that they couldn't prove this intention on prima facie evidence: no letters, no minutes, no witnesses to testify to a wicked burning of the midnight oil as the PIE executive endeavoured […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ffabfdb-15cd-44bc-840a-4f1c2d334dd4",
                                                "sense_id": "f7ed6987-7d36-3971-9e02-78740d184562",
